Lab 3: Creating Camel Routes
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Define and implement Apache Camel routes using Java DSL and XML DSL.
Use Camel components such as JMS, HTTP, and File as endpoints.
Test route functionality with different data sources and sinks.
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, ensure you have:

Java JDK 11+ installed.
Apache Maven installed.
Apache Camel 3.x dependencies (will be added via Maven).
A text editor (VS Code, IntelliJ, or Eclipse).
Basic knowledge of Java and XML.
Lab Setup
Create a Maven Project
mvn archetype:generate -DgroupId=com.example -DartifactId=camel-lab -DarchetypeArtifactId=maven-archetype-quickstart -DinteractiveMode=false
cd camel-lab
